3 Configuration
***************

*Service JSON* (main settings): ‘/etc/mcp-terminal/term_server.json’.
Full reference: ‘man mcp-terminal-config’.

‘/etc/default/mcp-terminal’
     Host Docker settings: port, paths, optional network, extra project
     bind mounts.
‘/etc/mcp-terminal/term_server.json’
     Service configuration (conffile).  Container path:
     ‘/etc/mcp-terminal/term_server.json’.  Seed:
     ‘/usr/share/mcp-terminal/term_server.json’.
‘/var/log/mcp-terminal’
     Application logs (owned by ‘mcp-terminal’).
‘/var/mcp-terminal’
     Application data and caches.
‘/etc/mcp-terminal/mtls_certificates’
     TLS certificates; use absolute ‘/etc/mcp-terminal/...’ paths inside
     JSON.

   Validate before recreate:

     python3 -m mcp_terminal.config.config_cli validate -c /etc/mcp-terminal/term_server.json

   Key JSON sections: ‘server’, ‘registration’, ‘queue_manager’,
‘watch_dirs’, ‘terminal’, ‘code_analysis’.  Set ‘server.log_dir’ to
‘/var/log/mcp-terminal’ and ‘server.host’ to ‘0.0.0.0’ in production.


