4 Service
*********

     sudo systemctl start mcp-terminal-docker
     sudo systemctl stop mcp-terminal-docker
     sudo mcp-terminal-docker recreate

   After configuration changes, run ‘mcp-terminal-docker recreate’ or
‘systemctl start mcp-terminal-docker-recreate.service’.

   The container mounts the host Docker socket.  Sandbox session
containers are created on the host by the service process inside the
container.


