5 Sandbox worker images and project paths
*****************************************

Sandbox images are listed in ‘/usr/lib/mcp-terminal/sandbox-images-spec’
(default registry ‘ghcr.io/mcp-terminal’).

   Project directories referenced in ‘watch_dirs’ must exist on the host
filesystem where the Docker daemon runs.  Bind-mount the same paths into
the service container using ‘MCP_TERMINAL_EXTRA_BINDS’ in
‘/etc/default/mcp-terminal’, for example:

     MCP_TERMINAL_EXTRA_BINDS=/home/projects:/home/projects


